---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Sobre SoftexLabs - Nosotros" description="Sobre SoftexLabs: Misión, visión e historia breve">
  <Header slot="header" />

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="py-20 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-purple-300 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl opacity-20"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-300 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl opacity-20"></div>

    <div class="relative text-center fade-in-up">
      <div class="inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-100 to-blue-100 rounded-full mb-6">
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-blue-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          Sobre Nosotros
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-tight mb-6">
        Transformando negocios <br/>
        <span class="gradient-text">con tecnología</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Softex nace con la necesidad de múltiples negocios de diferentes sectores como Spa, IPS, EPS y muchos otros, de agilizar y mejorar la gestión de citas para sus clientes de manera digital e intuitiva.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission & Vision -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="gradient-card p-10 rounded-3xl fade-in-left">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-blue-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-xl">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Nuestra Misión</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-lg">
          Acompañar a los emprendedores y pequeñas empresas en su camino hacia el crecimiento, ayudándolos a transformar sus procesos con el poder de la tecnología. Creemos que cada negocio merece herramientas simples pero poderosas que faciliten la gestión de sus citas, impulsen la productividad y mejoren la experiencia tanto de sus clientes como de su equipo.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 p-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-50 to-blue-50 rounded-xl border border-purple-100">
          <p class="text-purple-700 font-semibold">
            💡 Queremos que la tecnología sea su aliada para alcanzar el éxito
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gradient-card p-10 rounded-3xl fade-in-right delay-200">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-500 to-orange-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-xl">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path>
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Nuestra Visión</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-lg">
          Ser el aliado tecnológico líder en Latinoamérica, impulsando a emprendedores y pequeñas empresas a alcanzar su máximo potencial. Soñamos con un ecosistema donde la innovación y la tecnología sean accesibles para todos, ayudando a cada negocio a crecer, transformarse y dejar huella en el mundo.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 p-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-50 to-orange-50 rounded-xl border border-pink-100">
          <p class="text-pink-700 font-semibold">
            🚀 Democratizando la tecnología empresarial
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Values Section -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="text-center mb-16 fade-in-up">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
        Nuestros <span class="gradient-text">Valores</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Los principios que guían cada decisión y proyecto
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <div class="gradient-card p-8 rounded-2xl text-center fade-in-up delay-100">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-cyan-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 shadow-lg">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-slate-900 mb-2">Innovación</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">Soluciones tecnológicas de vanguardia</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gradient-card p-8 rounded-2xl text-center fade-in-up delay-200">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-pink-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 shadow-lg">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4.354a4 4 0 110 5.292M15 21H3v-1a6 6 0 0112 0v1zm0 0h6v-1a6 6 0 00-9-5.197M13 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-slate-900 mb-2">Compromiso</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">Dedicados al éxito de nuestros clientes</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gradient-card p-8 rounded-2xl text-center fade-in-up delay-300">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-green-500 to-emerald-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 shadow-lg">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-slate-900 mb-2">Confianza</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">Seguridad y transparencia en todo momento</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gradient-card p-8 rounded-2xl text-center fade-in-up delay-400">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500 to-red-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 shadow-lg">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-slate-900 mb-2">Crecimiento</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">Escalabilidad para tu futuro</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Choose Us Section -->
  <section class="py-20 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 via-blue-50 to-pink-50 opacity-50 rounded-3xl"></div>

    <div class="relative">
      <div class="text-center mb-16 fade-in-up">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
          ¿Por qué <span class="gradient-text">elegirnos</span>?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Beneficios que hacen la diferencia para tu negocio
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-2xl group hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 fade-in-up delay-100">
          <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-blue-500 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-3">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-900">Personalización</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-600">Soluciones adaptadas a las necesidades específicas de tu negocio</p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-2xl group hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 fade-in-up delay-200">
          <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-500 to-orange-500 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-3">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M18.364 5.636l-3.536 3.536m0 5.656l3.536 3.536M9.172 9.172L5.636 5.636m3.536 9.192l-3.536 3.536M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0zm-5 0a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-900">Soporte 24/7</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-600">Equipo dedicado disponible cuando lo necesites</p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-2xl group hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 fade-in-up delay-300">
          <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-green-500 to-emerald-500 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-3">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-900">Seguridad</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-600">Protección de datos empresarial de nivel bancario</p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-2xl group hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 fade-in-up delay-400">
          <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-cyan-500 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-3">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 12l3-3 3 3 4-4M8 21l4-4 4 4M3 4h18M4 4h16v12a1 1 0 01-1 1H5a1 1 0 01-1-1V4z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-900">Escalabilidad</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-600">Crece sin límites con infraestructura adaptable</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 via-blue-600 to-purple-600 opacity-90"></div>

      <div class="relative px-8 py-16 text-center fade-in-up">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
          ¿Quieres ser parte de nuestra historia?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-white/90 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Únete a cientos de empresas que están transformando sus negocios
        </p>
        <a href="/contacto" class="inline-flex items-center px-10 py-4 bg-white text-purple-600 rounded-full font-bold text-lg shadow-2xl hover:shadow-3xl hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300">
          Contáctanos
          <svg class="ml-2 w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"></path>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</BaseLayout>
